bin/
obj/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
# Anything hanging off a database file too: manual testing leaves things like
# mealplanner.db.testbackup-182628, which *.db does not match, and a stray
# git add -A then sweeps the kitchen's data into a commit.
*.db.*
.idea/
*.DotSettings.user
.claude/

# Nothing here needs a secret today — the app has no auth, and the classifier
# and recipe generator shell out to `claude -p`, which brings its own
# credentials. These are here so that stays true by default rather than by luck.
# For a real secret, prefer `dotnet user-secrets`, which keeps it out of the
# tree entirely instead of relying on a pattern below matching.
#
# appsettings.Development.json is deliberately NOT ignored — it is tracked and
# holds only config. Put a secret in appsettings.Local.json instead.
.env
.env.*
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.*.Local.json
secrets.json
credentials.json
.npmrc
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
id_rsa*
